{%- doc -%}
  Renders the Bow and Bloom bow, the ribbon motif used across the theme, as inline SVG.
  It takes its colour from `color`, so it follows the active colour scheme.

  @param {string} [style] - 'fill' for the solid satin bow (default) or 'line' for an outline that can draw itself.
  @param {string} [class] - Extra classes for the svg element.

  @example
  {% render 'bow', style: 'line', class: 'ribbon-divider__bow' %}
{%- enddoc -%}
